      "`RELEASING.md`: replace 'Recommended repository settings (owner)' with § Repository settings: apply commands (`gh api -X POST repos/axiomasoft/azguard-private/rulesets --input .github/rulesets/<file>.json`, update with `-X PUT .../rulesets/<id>`), PVR/secret-scanning commands, `php bin/repository-settings-audit.php --live`, break-glass (I-G5)"
